{"unit_id":"tag:0GDW:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002>、<MATH_0003>满足引理<REF_0001>的条件 (1)、(2)、(a)、(b)，用<MATH_0004>表示该引理中构造的唯一延拓（extension）。设<MATH_0005>。假设：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>(c)<ITEMCLOSE_0001> 对任意标准<MATH_0006>-覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007>，由仿射概形（affines）组成，位于<MATH_0008>中，使得<MATH_0009>经仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0010>分解（factors），且<MATH_0011>有限表现（finite presentation），则<MATH_0012>和<MATH_0013>满足层条件（sheaf condition）<FOOTNOTEOPEN_0001>这是有意义的，因为<MATH_0014>、<MATH_0015>和<MATH_0016>由 (2) 同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0017>的对象（objects）。<FOOTNOTECLOSE_0001>。\n<STRUCT_0002>\n则<MATH_0018>对所有<MATH_0019>-覆盖（coverings）满足层条件（sheaf condition）。\n","allowed_english":["a","b","c"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"延拓"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"factors","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表现"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"延拓","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affines","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"factors","target_term":"分解","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表现","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"sheaf condition","target_term":"层条件","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"待决"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"待决"}],"notes":[]}
